          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5.7.1 Angle subtended by an arc at a point on the circle outside the arc"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.452,
            0.886,
            0.55
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "By ʻangle subtended by arc AXB at a point on the circle outside the arcʼ we mean the angle ACB where C is any point on the circle but not on arc AXB. Remarkably, the measure of this angle does not depend upon which specific point C we pick, so long as it is on the circle and outside the arc!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.554,
            0.588,
            0.71
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Activity:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Draw a circle and a chord AB. Fix an arc AKB formed by AB and a point K between A, B on the circle. Measure the angle subtended at the centre by arc AKB. Take three points P, Q, R on the circle outside arc AKB. Measure the angles subtended by arc AKB at points P, Q, R. What do you notice?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.714,
            0.589,
            0.833
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Repeat this activity for a different arc AKB. Based on this activity, we can make a statement about the angles subtended by an arc of a circle at the centre and at a point of the circle outside the arc. We shall show that the following is true."
            }
          ]
        },
